<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa lower, sugar mixed.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa lower, sugar mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Opens lower, although Sept later recoups some losses. Trade light. Sept off four at 1,020 stg at 0949 GMT. COFFEE - Opens down, bucking unchanged call and falls further. Sept $19 down at $1,576, just off $1,572 low. SUGAR - Mixed in minimal volume. October 50 cents lower at $320.50</p>
</text>
